# Trill only: 10 pulses shrinking 25 -> 15 ms (taper), 15 ms gaps, then one 25 ms pulse on the same pitch; ~375 ms. The shape check off and the longest-stretch rule at 12 ms (decisions/2026-11-19-trill-only-drops-the-shape-check.md; owner 2026-11-20 accepts the 12 ms rule); glide: each trill pulse falls 150 Hz, 4 ms soft edges, the first 3 pulses swell (as fieldcricket). Names: owner 2026-11-20.
PARAM SET output.hop_trill_gap_ms 15
PARAM SET output.hop_gap_ms 0
PARAM SET detection.scalar_release_debounce_ms 20
PARAM SET output.trill_pulse_jitter_ms 0
PARAM SET output.broadband_scope 0
PARAM SET output.broadband_low_hz 6500
PARAM SET output.hop_trill_pulses 10
PARAM SET output.hop_steps 1
PARAM SET output.hop_pulse_ms 25
PARAM SET output.trill_pulse_end_ms 15
PARAM SET detection.shape_medium_min_bins 1
PARAM SET detection.shape_medium_min_rising_steps 0
PARAM SET detection.scalar_min_longest_island_ms 12
PARAM SET output.trill_fade_ms 4
PARAM SET output.trill_droop_hz 150
PARAM SET output.trill_swell_pulses 3
PARAM SET output.broadband_level 0
